      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "801．指出下列和式中各项的公因式，并且把各式分解因",
        "式：",
        "а) $5a(x+c)+b(x+c)$；",
        "б) $x(y-1)-3(y-1)$；",
        "в) $y(a+b)-(a+b)$；",
        "г) $(p-q)+b(p-q)$；",
        "д) $12c(c-y)-6y(c-y)$；",
        "е) $-35p(p+8)-42(p+8)$；",
        "ж) $(a+y)-2a(a+y)$；",
        "з) $6x^2(x-z)+(x-z)^2$；",
        "и) $5x(x-y)+(2x+y)(x-y)$；",
        "к) $(7a+4b)(a-b)-6a(a-b)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "802",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "802．把下列各式化成两个多项式的积：",
        "а) $a(c-b)+a(b-c)$；",
        "б) $x(y-5)-y(5-y)$；",
        "в) $3a(2x-7)+5b(7-2x)$；",
        "г) $17p(3p^2-q^2)-2q(q^2-3p^2)$；",
        "д) $5k(b-c)+3n(c-b)-m(b-c)$；",
        "е) $(a-3b)-2x(3b-a)+4y(3b-a)$；",
        "ж) $(x-y)^2-a(y-x)$；",
        "з) $(2a-3b)^2+c(3b-2a)$．"
